{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And you shall say.</b> The sense of בני בכורי: this is the nation whose fathers served me from the first, and I have compassion on it as a man has compassion on his son who serves him, and you take him as an eternal servant — therefore I will kill your firstborn son."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:39.376143744Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}